      "severities": [
        "WARNING"
      ],
      "text": "Departure `time` (specified in [StopTimeEvent](#stoptimeevent)) should be the same as the arrival `time` for the same stop if no layover or dwell time is expected - otherwise, departure `time` should be after arrival `time` .",
      "sha256": "9f2913e3898d6c3860b4fd025da536a15a3219e0c9c1411b3d8d9b8f395fbeee",
